invalid type: string "Students are the owners of their own narrative.\nWe really want to get to know as much about a student as we possibly can.\nStop trying to fit into the box that you think I want you to fit into and make your own box.\nA lot of times students get so caught up in thinking about what I want to hear that you lose sight of who you are and what you are most passionate about.\nÿÿÿÿÿ